{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0043686 co-translational protein modification\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30140\nThis is part of the ongoing work to remove single step MF terms from the BP ontology\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jXHmnzVQHq4fVDQmdfCZ_cE6wPzLXe-SYko1bhW2nxk/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n   1 EcoCyc @amandamackie\n   1 GeneDB @pgaudet \n   ~1 TAIR~ @tberardini \n   6 UniProt @pgaudet \n\nReannotation suggestions in spreadsheet\n\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n[LIST IDs + ADD ASSIGNEES] \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-04-30T08:53:28Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "reg_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0043686 co-translational protein modification", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-08-25T17:04:44Z"}
